menu "CTF crypto track"

config CTF_CRYPTO_DEV
    bool "Crypto track dev self-test (prints derived CRY-01 key shards at boot)"
    default n
    help
        Development only (SPEC "Cross-track rules", dev self-test). Prints all
        four CRY-01 key shards at boot so the CRY-01 solver can be tested
        before the BLE/BTC/web tracks exist. Release builds keep it off.

endmenu
